  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform solid cylindrical roller of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is being pulled on a horizontal surface with force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> parallel to the surface and applied at its centre. If the acceleration of the cylinder is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and it is rolling without slipping then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
